            <ArticleTitle>Review of upper and lower extremity musculoskeletal pain problems.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>747-60, vi-vii</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article reviews common causes of upper and lower extremity pain problems, including bone pain, osteoarthritis, tendinopathy, and muscle pain problems. These common conditions affect many areas of the body; knowledge of their diagnosis and treatment guides the rehabilitation of many patients who have musculoskeletal complaints.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
